WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.025
Section 4.

00:00:01.975 --> 00:00:04.437
Phoenix Pay and Veterans.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:06.300
Broken Twice.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:18.075
The 2.2 billion dollar Phoenix Pay failure devastated veterans transitioning to federal employment, leaving many without paychecks while simultaneously navigating the disability backlog.
